old" fill="#92400e">Invariants — enforced by root: Invoice</text><rect x="47" y="376" width="6" height="6" transform="rotate(45 50 379)" fill="#f59e0b"></rect><text x="62" y="382" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">An invoice is created from exactly one placed order, referenced by order id</text><rect x="47" y="401" width="6" height="6" transform="rotate(45 50 404)" fill="#f59e0b"></rect><text x="62" y="407" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">Line amounts and the billing address are copied from the order message — a later price or address</text><text x="62" y="423" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">change elsewhere never alters a sent invoice</text><rect x="47" y="442" width="6" height="6" transform="rotate(45 50 445)" fill="#f59e0b"></rect><text x="62" y="448" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">The invoice total equals the sum of its line amounts</text><rect x="47" y="467" width="6" height="6" transform="rotate(45 50 470)" fill="#f59e0b"></rect><text x="62" y="473" font-size="12" fill="#78350f">Consuming the same OrderPlaced message twice does not produce a second invoice</text></g><g class="d5-legend"><rect x="30" y="545" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="white" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="3"></rect><text x="50" y="556" font-size="11" fill="#64748b">Aggregate Root</text><rect x="156.43000000000004" y="545" width="14" height="14" rx="3" fill="white" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2"></rect><text x="176.43000000000004" y="556" font-size="11" fill="#64748b">Entity</text><rect x="234.35000000000002" y="545" width="14" height="14" rx="7" fill="white" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2"></rect><text x="254.35000000000002" y="556" font-size="11" fill="#64748b">Value Object</text></g>"`;

